#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up an online lab environment to use Qiskit in the cloud. Choose a preconfigured environment or set up your own."
msgstr "Mag-set up ng online na lab environment para gamitin ang Qiskit sa cloud. Pumili ng preconfigured na environment o gumawa ng sarili mo."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments"
msgstr "Mga online na lab environment"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"online-environments\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Online lab environments {#online-lab-environments}"
msgstr "Mga online na lab environment {#online-lab-environments}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition to downloading and installing Qiskit to work on your local machine, there are several options available for those who prefer to work in an online development environment.\n"
msgstr "Bukod sa pag-download at pag-install ng Qiskit para gamitin sa iyong lokal na makina, may ilang pagpipilian para sa mga gustong magtrabaho sa isang online na development environment.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Several providers offer online Jupyter environments with Qiskit preinstalled for fast and convenient onboarding. These recommended providers include the cloud service provider OVHcloud and the quantum software development cloud platform qBraid.\n"
msgstr "May ilang provider na nag-aalok ng online na Jupyter environment na may naka-preinstall na Qiskit para sa mabilis at maginhawang onboarding. Kasama sa mga inirerekomendang provider na ito ang cloud service provider na OVHcloud at ang quantum software development cloud platform na qBraid.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended notebook environments with Qiskit preinstalled {#recommended-notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"
msgstr "Mga inirerekomendang notebook environment na may naka-preinstall na Qiskit {#recommended-notebook-environments-with-qiskit-preinstalled}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional online Jupyter notebook environments like IBM Watson&reg; Studio, Google Colab, and Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio can be used to work with Qiskit by following the appropriate instructions.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga karagdagang online na Jupyter notebook environment tulad ng IBM Watson&reg; Studio, Google Colab, at Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio ay maaaring gamitin kasama ang Qiskit sa pamamagitan ng pagsunod sa naaangkop na mga tagubilin.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVHcloud AI notebooks {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"
msgstr "OVHcloud AI notebooks {#ovhcloud-ai-notebooks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVHcloud Public Cloud and OVHcloud Startup users can use their OVHcloud quantum notebooks to access Qiskit and submit jobs to IBM&reg; QPUs with their IBM Quantum&reg; or IBM Cloud&reg; account. To learn more, visit the [OVHcloud Documentation and tutorials](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-documentation?id=kb_home) page.\n"
msgstr "Maaaring gumamit ang mga user ng OVHcloud Public Cloud at OVHcloud Startup ng kanilang OVHcloud quantum notebooks para ma-access ang Qiskit at mag-submit ng mga job sa IBM&reg; QPUs gamit ang kanilang IBM Quantum&reg; o IBM Cloud&reg; account. Para matuto pa, bisitahin ang pahina ng [OVHcloud Documentation and tutorials](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/world-documentation?id=kb_home).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"OVHcloud AI notebooks are not available in some regions, such as the United States. Additionally, user interfaces might look different in different regions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Hindi available ang mga OVHcloud AI notebook sa ilang rehiyon, tulad ng United States. Bukod dito, maaaring magkakaiba ang hitsura ng mga user interface sa iba't ibang rehiyon.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow these steps to get started:\n"
msgstr "Sundin ang mga hakbang na ito para makapagsimula:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Gumawa ng IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up an OVHcloud account](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-create-ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022).\n"
msgstr "[Mag-set up ng OVHcloud account](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-account-create-ovhcloud-account?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0043022).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an OVH Public Cloud project](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project).\n"
msgstr "[Gumawa ng OVH Public Cloud project](https://support.us.ovhcloud.com/hc/en-us/articles/360002245784-Creating-Your-First-Public-Cloud-Project).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '6. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Follow the steps in [Launch your first AI Notebook](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270), selecting **Qiskit** for the framework.\n"
msgstr "Sundin ang mga hakbang sa [Launch your first AI Notebook](https://help.ovhcloud.com/csm/en-public-cloud-ai-notebooks-definition?id=kb_article_view&sysparm_article=KB0048270), at piliin ang **Qiskit** para sa framework.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"
msgstr "qBraid Lab {#qbraid-lab}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit users can use qBraid's preconfigured Python environments by following these instructions. For more information, see the [qBraid Docs](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction).\n"
msgstr "Maaaring gumamit ang mga Qiskit user ng mga preconfigured na Python environment ng qBraid sa pamamagitan ng pagsunod sa mga tagubiling ito. Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, tingnan ang [qBraid Docs](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/introduction).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up an qBraid free account](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account).\n"
msgstr "[Mag-set up ng libreng qBraid account](https://docs.qbraid.com/home/account).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Lab environment](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-started).\n"
msgstr "[Gumawa ng Lab environment](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/getting-started).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Launch qBraid Lab, click the **ENVS** icon on the right, click **+ ADD** at the top of the new sidebar, and search for Qiskit.  Click the version you want to use, then click **Install**.\n"
msgstr "I-launch ang qBraid Lab, i-click ang icon na **ENVS** sa kanan, i-click ang **+ ADD** sa itaas ng bagong sidebar, at hanapin ang Qiskit. I-click ang bersyon na gusto mong gamitin, pagkatapos ay i-click ang **Install**.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a Jupyter notebook by clicking **Python 3 [Qiskit]** in the Notebook section.\n"
msgstr "Gumawa ng Jupyter notebook sa pamamagitan ng pag-click sa **Python 3 [Qiskit]** sa seksyon ng Notebook.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can install any additional Python packages (Such as Qiskit v1.2) in a notebook cell by running `%pip install [package_name].` For more information, see the [Pip (magic) commands](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-commands) topic.\n"
msgstr "Maaari kang mag-install ng karagdagang mga Python package (tulad ng Qiskit v1.2) sa isang notebook cell sa pamamagitan ng pagpapatakbo ng `%pip install [package_name].` Para sa karagdagang impormasyon, tingnan ang paksa na [Pip (magic) commands](https://docs.qbraid.com/lab/user-guide/notebooks#pip-magic-commands).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Additional notebook environments for Qiskit users {#additional-notebook-environments-for-qiskit-users}"
msgstr "Mga karagdagang notebook environment para sa mga gumagamit ng Qiskit {#additional-notebook-environments-for-qiskit-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For platforms without Qiskit preconfigured, the setup instructions are similar, except that you must install Qiskit manually. You will create an account, start a new project (or notebook or workspace, depending on the platform), and install Qiskit.\n"
msgstr "Para sa mga platform na walang naka-preconfigure na Qiskit, magkapareho ang mga tagubilin sa pag-setup, maliban na kailangan mong i-install ang Qiskit nang manu-mano. Gagawa ka ng account, magsisimula ng bagong project (o notebook o workspace, depende sa platform), at i-install ang Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Watson Studio {#ibm-watson-studio}"
msgstr "IBM Watson Studio {#ibm-watson-studio}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up Watson Studio free trial](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/watson?topic=watson-about).\n"
msgstr "[Mag-set up ng libreng trial sa Watson Studio](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/watson?topic=watson-about).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Watson Studio Project](https://www.ibm.com/docs/db2-event-store/2.0.0?topic=data-projects#d275537e106).\n"
msgstr "[Gumawa ng Watson Studio Project](https://www.ibm.com/docs/db2-event-store/2.0.0?topic=data-projects#d275537e106).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "To install the Qiskit packages and dependencies needed, open a new notebook and run the following command:\n"
msgstr "Para i-install ang mga kinakailangang Qiskit package at dependencies, magbukas ng bagong notebook at patakbuhin ang sumusunod na command:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Google Colab {#google-colab}"
msgstr "Google Colab {#google-colab}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Google account](https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/27441?hl).\n"
msgstr "[Gumawa ng Google account](https://support.google.com/accounts/answer/27441?hl).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Go to the [Google Colab landing page](https://colab.research.google.com/) and sign in with your Google account.\n"
msgstr "Pumunta sa [Google Colab landing page](https://colab.research.google.com/) at mag-sign in gamit ang iyong Google account.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Colab notebook](https://colab.research.google.com/#create=true) and install Qiskit by running the following command:\n"
msgstr "[Gumawa ng Colab notebook](https://colab.research.google.com/#create=true) at i-install ang Qiskit sa pamamagitan ng pagpapatakbo ng sumusunod na command:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio {#microsoft-azure-machine-learning-studio}"
msgstr "Microsoft Azure Machine Learning Studio {#microsoft-azure-machine-learning-studio}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create an Azure account](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/azure/create-azure-account).\n"
msgstr "[Gumawa ng Azure account](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/azure/create-azure-account).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a workspace](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/machine-learning/concept-workspace?view=azureml-api-2#create-a-workspace).\n"
msgstr "[Gumawa ng workspace](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/machine-learning/concept-workspace?view=azureml-api-2#create-a-workspace).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Create a Jupyter notebook in your workspace](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/machine-learning/how-to-run-jupyter-notebooks?view=azureml-api-2).\n"
msgstr "[Gumawa ng Jupyter notebook sa iyong workspace](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/machine-learning/how-to-run-jupyter-notebooks?view=azureml-api-2).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
